WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:33.780
Hang on!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.120
Now's our chance!

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.130
We're in!

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:52.800
Okay, land on the Egg Carrier.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.420
Oh no!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.510
After transforming, this plane has no legs!

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:00.930
What?

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:10.750
Episode 30

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:10.750
Egg Carrier Battle

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:17.070
Let's go.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:17.650
Yeah.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:18.740
Alright!

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.120
I'm going ahead!

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.410
Launch the attack!

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:22.700
Right!

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:22.830
Let's do this! Right!

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.410
Let's do this!

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:33.540
What is it?

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:34.630
Tails.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.010
Are you okay?

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:37.090
Yeah!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:41.840
Alright!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.770
Sonic, sorry but I'm going to look for the Master Emerald.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:49.310
Knuckles!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.650
Knuckles has his own mission.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.770
Let's go and rescue Amy.

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:55.690
Let's go, Tails!

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:56.360
Okay!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:58.280
Take this!

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.700
How? Take this!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.820
In this case...

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.750
Gamma!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.710
You're up!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.880
Come quickly to Rear Deck 1!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.010
Is Mr. Robot going to fight Sonic?

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:21.840
We won't let you escape.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:22.470
Yeah!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.050
Did you say something?

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.810
Calm down.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.350
Are you ready?

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.690
Eggman!

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.400
How unladylike.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.350
Hey hey!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:37.650
If you're gonna chase after girls, choose a better one, Eggman.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.860
Sonic...

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:42.320
What do you mean by that!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.160
You're finished, Eggman.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.790
No way!

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.420
Lily!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.290
Oh no!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.380
Well done, Decoe and Bocoe.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:03:59.800
Thank you. Well done, Decoe and Bocoe.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:00.210
Thank you.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.590
Let's see...

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:08.890
How rude of you to steal this and flee!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.390
It's a Chaos Emerald!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:15.440
No way!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.940
As long as I have this, I don't need you anymore.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:21.280
So I'll give it back to you.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:22.820
Lily.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.070
I'm so glad.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:34.500
Did you call me, Dr. Eggman?

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.130
Mr. Robot.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:39.250
Shoot that blue hedgehog full of holes!

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:40.800
Aye aye, sir.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:41.760
Don't do it!

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.260
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.010
What do you mean by that?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.140
You wanna fight?

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.060
It's Dr. Eggman's orders.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.680
Stop it, both of you!

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.270
This robot is a good robot.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.270
Good robot?

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.020
Yes, that's why…

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.150
Stop it!

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.370
What's going on?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.290
Beats me.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.790
Stop!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.050
You're going all out.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:31.680
Take another!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.690
Here comes the final blow!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.610
Stop, Sonic.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.900
That's Eggman's mecha, Amy. Move out of the way.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:50.320
This robot is not an evil robot.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.080
That's why...

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.420
Okay. I understand, Amy.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.580
I guess you have your reasons.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.470
Sonic, this ship…

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.560
We're losing altitude!

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:13.640
What?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:14.930
Dr. Eggman!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.430
We have to do something!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:17.770
I know!

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.690
Wait up!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.690
We have to go after Eggman!

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.820
I'll catch Eggman.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.940
You take Amy and get out of here.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.150
What?

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:31.240
You came here even though you were hurt because you wanted to rescue Amy, right?

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.740
- Mr. Robot, wake up.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.070
- Mr. Robot!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.530
Yes but...

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.580
There's no time to waste. Hurry!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.040
But…

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:41.330
Come on now. I'm asking you to do an important job.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:45.590
Okay.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:46.550
See you!

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.760
Mr. Robot!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.590
- Let's go, Amy!

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:51.340
Mr. Robot!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.430
Mr. Robot!

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.560
Are you awake?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.480
This place is dangerous.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:07.150
You don't have to listen to Eggman anymore. You should flee to somewhere far away.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.320
Why are you saving me?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.910
Because I said that the next time we meet, we'll meet as friends.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:25.040
Mr. Robot, I hope we meet again!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.560
Is it in here?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.640
It's Froggy.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.560
We have to help it!

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.690
The floor is...

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:54.320
What should we do?

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.740
I don't know.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.870
Hey!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.380
Tails! Amy!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.840
I was waiting just in case.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.510
Sonic…

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.510
I wonder if he's okay.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.180
Ouch!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.310
Again?

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:31.400
I gathered all the remaining pieces of the Master Emerald, so now I have to escape.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.340
Again?

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.420
What's happening this time?

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:56.890
What happened?

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:07.020
I couldn't stop them. Father and the others finally came here, but I never imagined it would turn out like this.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.730
What was that?

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:13.780
Oh no!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:18.620
That's...

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.540
Hey!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.040
Wait!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.750
Wait up!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:32.250
What was that? Am I going insane?

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:41.970
Calm down, Big.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.310
But I can't stay calm.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.640
How troublesome...

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.150
Are you calm now?

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.570
I'm calm.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.150
Good. Now then...

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.110
Are you sure this is going to work?

00:09:58.660 --> 00:09:59.740
Y-Yeah.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:05.540
Hang in there!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.920
Just a little more...

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.840
I can't do it.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:20.590
After all, I'm only in elementary school.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:22.640
I'm giving up and heading back.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:28.390
Just wait, Froggy,

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:32.860
Chris will rescue you.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.610
I made it!

00:10:39.820 --> 00:10:43.200
Aren't you happy, Froggy?

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.130
Eggman!

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:03.550
Sonic!

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:23.530
Oh my!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.490
So you escaped.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:32.370
Chaos, this frog has the Chaos Emerald and your tail.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:33.750
What?

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.630
Anyway, let's run!

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:37.750
Okay.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.470
Froggy!

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.440
C'mon.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:01.490
I have this Chaos Emerald and the one I retrieved from the bird.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:04.160
Chaos, I'm giving you these two Emeralds.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.820
Take it.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:26.930
Chaos, once you absorb this frog, you will become perfect.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:27.800
Take it.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:28.970
Froggy!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:31.520
No!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.940
Big!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.230
That's no good.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:41.940
Sorry about this.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:43.820
I have it!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.240
How reckless.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.240
See? Just as I expected.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:00.590
All right!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.670
Sonic!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.800
Chris, why are you here?

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.260
Sonic...

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.720
Chris!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.690
Hang on, Chris!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.360
Chris!

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:31.870
Go, Chaos! Beat Sonic to a pulp!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.920
Whoa!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.760
Good, Chaos! Finish him off!

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.390
Sonic!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:51.430
This doesn't hurt at all...

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.640
What?

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.230
Knuckles!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.810
I guess it's my turn.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:00.770
What are you going to do?

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.320
What else?

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.360
That... as usual?

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.360
What do you mean by that?

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.030
Don't you know?

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:12.490
Chaos's body absorbs impacts.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.910
So this monster is like solid jelly.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:20.460
I'm hard-boiled, so I hate boneless softies!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.670
It may not have bones, but it seems to have a core.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:25.630
Is that it?

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.380
Probably.

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.090
Are you ready?

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:33.680
Yeah! See ya!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.930
Shovel Claw!

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:39.310
Sonic!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.230
Take this!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.030
Froggy.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:53.740
I'm taking back the Chaos Emeralds.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.660
Hey Chris, are you all right?

00:14:58.870 --> 00:14:59.870
Yeah!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:04.540
But how are we going to escape from this ship?

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:07.630
Tails left X-Tornado behind.

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:08.470
We'll use that.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.130
Quietly... Quietly...

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:12.180
Dr. Eggman!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.100
What about us?

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.600
Eggman, wait up!

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:16.810
I'm not going to wait!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.350
Dr. Eggman!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.100
I got you!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.230
Let go!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.060
I'm not letting go!

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.150
Sonic...

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.610
There's no need to worry about him. More importantly...

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.530
It's cramped in here.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.070
What are you doing?

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:34.240
What does this button do?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.660
- Do you know how to fly that?

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.740
Stop! Don't touch anything!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.540
We'll be right there!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:41.420
Huh? Did I push something that I shouldn't have?

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.000
- Stop it!

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.870
- Don't do it!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.830
Then how about this?

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.510
We're going to fall!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.350
Everyone's gone.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.810
Then we should also leave.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:01.560
Then let's take these. Ready?

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.770
What beautiful scenery.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:05.360
You can say that again.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.780
I wonder if Sonic is okay.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.820
Sonic always has to rescue me.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.570
That's no good.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.500
You surprised me.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.620
I didn't know you had the Chaos Emerald, Lily.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.330
No wonder Eggman was so persistent in capturing you.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.880
Are they your siblings?

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:34.630
Eggman still has them trapped?

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:39.010
When Eggman captured you all, you were the only one who managed to escape?

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.270
I see...

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.440
All right then!

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.060
I'll rescue them!

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.190
I'll do anything for you.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:11.800
How dare of Dr. Eggman to let go of the oar! That's cheating!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:21.680
Until a few weeks ago, I was the President's aide. But now...

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.680
I'm digging through the trash!

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:26.270
I'm going to cry!

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:31.940
Eggman!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:32.940
Who are you?

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:36.070
It's me! I'm Jerome, the President's former aide!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.280
Oh, it's you.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.950
I'm in a bad mood today.

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.870
I'm barely making a living right now. Help me!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:47.710
I'll give you something special.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.170
Give it to me!

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.460
Here you go.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.710
Thank you!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.420
What is it?

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:57.880
A missile!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.190
Roll the cameras!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:15.990
Big trouble! A gigantic missile has suddenly appeared in downtown Station Square!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:19.070
Launching the missile with a push of a button.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.620
Farewell, Station Square.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.370
I'm returning to Final Egg.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.390
This is bad! What should i do?

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.050
Sonic.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:50.310
What's going on?

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.360
Was it a dud?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.110
Call the police!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.570
No, the fire department!

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:02.700
Thank goodness.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:06.240
People, listen carefully!

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.870
I have a message from Dr. Eggman!

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.960
Well, um...

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.630
These things happen every now and then.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:18.300
But Dr. Eggman will not betray your expectations.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:22.760
Just in case, I placed a timer in the missile.

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:25.760
You only have two minutes remaining.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:31.560
This robot will begin the countdown until the explosion.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.060
You must be kidding.

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:35.320
Come on, start counting!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:39.690
<i>120, 119, 118…</i>

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:42.110
What should I do? What would Sonic do in this situation?

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:47.410
<i>...117, 116, 115, 114, 113...</i>

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.410
I'll solve it somehow!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:52.960
<i>...112, 111, 110, 109...</i>

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.750
Don't look at me like that!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:58.800
I'm not Sonic! But…

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.680
Everyone is counting on me.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.140
I'm the only one who can save them.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:09.270
I'm going to protect Station Square!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.390
Alright!

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:17.020
Tails is attempting to stop the time bomb.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:21.030
The cords of this time bomb are tangled up.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:25.740
Which cord do I cut? If I cut the wrong one, it will explode.

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.950
But there's no time.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.580
Sonic…

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:43.170
I changed, thanks to my encounter with Sonic.

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:46.680
But I can't just keep running behind Sonic!

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:51.310
I'm going to run with my own power someday!

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:54.560
Stay calm. Just stay calm.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:58.770
This cord comes here, so…

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.280
It's this one!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.240
Did I do it?

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.700
I did it!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.540
Thank you, Tails!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:21.500
Well...

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:24.970
What is it?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:27.720
Hey you...

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:32.220
Prepare to lose the next time we meet, idiot!

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:39.360
Come to think of it, what happened to X-Tornado?

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:53.410
We're safe.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.620
Where are you going?

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.830
I'm going back to Angel Island.

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:02.500
Where are we?

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:05.010
Somewhere in Mystic Ruins.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:08.720
That scared me big time!

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:10.350
'Big' time?

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:13.220
Was that a joke? It was kinda lame...

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.230
Froggy.

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:24.860
A Chaos Emerald!

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:27.820
The seventh Chaos Emerald.

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:29.950
Knuckles!

00:22:34.990 --> 00:22:36.910
He's gone...

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:43.210
Then let's go home.

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.590 --> 00:25:35.360
Gamma the Wanderer
